libacm
------------------------------------------
Library for InterPlay ACM Audio format

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libacm-devel-1.5-1bl1
  libacm1-1.5-1bl1
  libao4-1.2.2-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libao-devel-1.2.2-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/markokr/libacm

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/markokr/libacm/archive/refs/tags/libacm_v1.5.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libacm-1.5-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libacm-1.5-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libacm-1.5-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libacm-1.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libacm1-1.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libacm-devel-1.5-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libacm)
  /usr/bin/acmtool.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libacm.README
  /usr/share/doc/libacm/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libacm/NEWS.md
  /usr/share/doc/libacm/README.md

(libacm1)
  /usr/bin/cygacm-1.dll

(libacm-devel)
  /usr/include/libacm.h
  /usr/lib/libacm.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libacm.pc

